  message: "2026-10-25: scope widened on the owner's request (description section 'SCOPE WIDENED'): (A) readers with no producer, (B) catalogue/overlay/taint/claims YAML keys as knobs, (C) reader classification display/presence/branch plus the per-question shapes (WI-monul, WI-gidid), (D) consumer-side subsets of a registered vocabulary, with a partition gate filed as its own item. This sweep now decides WI-fomif, WI-mujug and the call_type/method keep (WI-sorav, WI-kuhoh). Now blocks WI-fomif and WI-mujug; WI-sorav and WI-kuhoh are not blocked, because only one part of each is in scope."  # d8de
